sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as Application API
    participant S as Session Store
    B->>A: POST /auth/login over HTTPS
    A->>A: Validate input and verify password hash
    A->>S: Create new session after rotating identifier
    S-->>A: Session persisted
    A-->>B: Set-Cookie with HttpOnly, SameSite, Secure in production
    B->>A: GET /auth/me with eligible cookie
    A->>S: Look up session and validate expiry
    S-->>A: Session state
    A->>A: Apply account and authorization policy
    A-->>B: Safe profile or denial
    Note over B,A: Cookie delivery does not itself prove resource permission
